Of course! Here is a complete, single-file HTML template for a modern, responsive CS:GO website.

### Key Features of this Template:

*   **Single File:** All HTML, CSS, and JavaScript are in one file for easy use. Just save it as `index.html` and open it in your browser.
*   **Modern Design:** A dark theme popular with gaming sites, using a clean layout.
*   **Responsive:** The design adapts to different screen sizes, from mobile phones to large desktops.
*   **Semantic HTML5:** Uses tags like `<header>`, `<main>`, `<section>`, and `<footer>` for better structure and SEO.
*   **External Libraries:** Uses Google Fonts for typography and Font Awesome for icons, loaded via a CDN (Content Delivery Network).
*   **Well-Commented:** The code includes comments to explain what each section does and how you can customize it.

### How to Use:

1.  **Copy** the entire code below.
2.  **Paste** it into a new file in a text editor (like VS Code, Sublime Text, or even Notepad).
3.  **Save** the file with the name `index.html`.
4.  **Open** `index.html` in your web browser to see the website.
5.  **Customize:**
    *   Replace placeholder text with your own content.
    *   Change image URLs in the `src="..."` attributes to your own images. I've used placeholders from `https://placehold.co`.
    *   Adjust colors and styles in the `<style>` section to match your brand.

---

### Complete `index.html` Code

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CS:GO Hub - Your Ultimate Counter-Strike Source</title>

    <!-- Meta Tags for SEO -->
    <meta name="description" content="The ultimate hub for Counter-Strike: Global Offensive news, matches, guides, and community. Stay updated with the latest in the CS:GO esports scene.">
    <meta name="keywords" content="CSGO, Counter-Strike, Esports, Gaming, CS GO News, CS GO Matches, CS GO Guides">

    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@400;700;900&family=Bebas+Neue&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- Font Awesome for Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

    <!-- CSS Styles -->
    <style>
        /* ------------------- */
        /* --- GLOBAL STYLES --- */
        /* ------------------- */
        :root {
            --primary-color: #ff9900; /* CS:GO Orange/Gold */
            --secondary-color: #5ea0d9; /* CT Blue */
            --dark-bg: #121212;
            --light-bg: #1e1e1e;
            --text-color: #e0e0e0;
            --text-muted: #888;
            --font-main: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            --font-headings: 'Bebas Neue', cursive;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--font-main);
            background-color: var(--dark-bg);
            color: var(--text-color);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 20px 0;
        }

        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: var(--font-headings);
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        a {
            color: var(--primary-color);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        img {
            max-width: 100%;
            display: block;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--primary-color);
            color: var(--dark-bg);
            padding: 12px 30px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: background 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: #ffac33;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        section {
            padding: 80px 0;
        }

        /* ------------------- */
        /* --- HEADER & NAV --- */
        /* ------------------- */
        .main-header {
            background: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            padding: 15px 0;
            position: fixed;
            width: 100%;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
        }

        .main-header .container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .logo {
            font-family: var(--font-headings);
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--text-color);
        }

        .logo i {
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }

        .main-nav ul {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .main-nav ul li a {
            color: var(--text-color);
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .main-nav ul li a:hover, .main-nav ul li a.active {
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }

        .mobile-nav-toggle {
            display: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        /* ---------------- */
        /* --- HERO SECTION --- */
        /* ---------------- */
        #hero {
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            color: #fff;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.7), rgba(0,0,0,0.7)), url('https://placehold.co/1920x1080/000000/FFFFFF?text=CS:GO+Action+Shot') no-repeat center center/cover;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .hero-content h1 {
            font-size: 6rem;
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero-content p {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        /* ---------------- */
        /* --- NEWS SECTION --- */
        /* ---------------- */
        #news {
            background: var(--light-bg);
        }

        .news-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .news-card {
            background: var(--dark-bg);
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .news-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .news-card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .news-card-content {
            padding: 25px;
        }

        .news-card-content h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--text-color);
        }

        .news-card-content .meta {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .news-card-content p {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* ---------------- */
        /* -- MATCHES SECTION -- */
        /* ---------------- */
        .match-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .match-item {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 100px 1fr 200px 150px;
            align-items: center;
            background: var(--light-bg);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .team {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            font-family: var(--font-headings);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
        }

        .team.team-a {
            justify-content: flex-end;
        }

        .team img {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            margin: 0 15px;
        }

        .vs {
            font-family: var(--font-headings);
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }

        .match-info {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .match-info span {
            display: block;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--text-color);
        }

        .watch-btn {
            background-color: var(--secondary-color);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .watch-btn:hover {
            background-color: #74b2e4;
        }


        /* -----------------*/
        /* -- GUID

